"""Basic CPZ settings TUI.

Runs in the last tmux tab. Keeps settings in
~/.config/cpz/settings.conf (created on first change); the read-only system
defaults are /etc/cpz/settings.conf. Theme changes apply to the live tmux
server immediately, font changes replace the visible terminal, display
changes trigger the output reconciler, and language changes switch the CPZ
catalogs, the session locale and /etc/locale.conf. Other values are picked up
by cpz-status / tmux on the next refresh.
"""

